{"id":"91d6f7a1d8de5ec3","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-proof-system-join-universal.md","title":"二元证明系统合并的最小上界性质","display":"thm-proof-system-join-universal — 二元证明系统合并的最小上界性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-proof-system-join-universal","aliases":["72-thm-proof-system-join-universal"],"display":"thm-proof-system-join-universal — 二元证明系统合并的最小上界性质","depends_on":["[[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §2.4 print552/PDF564; local universal property of the existing tagged join","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-proof-system-join-universal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-proof-system-join-universal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-proof-system-join-universal — 二元证明系统合并的最小上界性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e05c057af8087ec\" href=\"?note=7e05c057af8087ec\" title=\"72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates\">72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §2.4 print552/PDF564; local universal property of the existing tagged join"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>P、Q、R 为相同公式编码上的 Cook–Reckhow 系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\\in\\{\\le_p,\\le_{\\rm sim}\\}\">\\(\\preceq\\in\\{\\le_p,\\le_{\\rm sim}\\}\\)</span> 使用本册的两种模拟。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\preceq R\\land Q\\preceq R\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(P\\sqcup Q)\\preceq R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\preceq R\\land Q\\preceq R\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(P\\sqcup Q)\\preceq R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逆向由两个已知注入模拟与传递性。正向的长度模拟按首位选择 P 或 Q 的界，两个非负系数多项式相加并增添常数，覆盖空串的固定重言式。p模拟按首位运行相应转换；空串使用 R 的一份固定 τ₀ 证明，存在性由满射保证。该固定证书可以作为算法常量，不需要在运行时搜索。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates","status":"resolved","id":"7e05c057af8087ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\preceq\\in\\{\\le_p,\\le_{\\rm sim}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\preceq R\\land Q\\preceq R\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad(P\\sqcup Q)\\preceq R.","display":true}],"bytes":1450,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"5d6d95eb13748e1d","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] 